            <profile id="9d29-f7ea-8fb3-aab1" name="Equipment and options (as printed in WAB2 army list)" publicationId="fcb9-17be-94c2-bcfc" hidden="false" typeId="b19e-ee0c-17d1-6e33" typeName="Equipment and Notes">
              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hittite Chariot have Driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, thrusting spear, javelins, light armour and shield. May add a second crewman to gain an extra attack, armed with javelins (+ 7 points). Light Chariots. Maryannu Chariot have Driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, bow, light armour and shield. Option: May have thrusting spear (+6 points) and javelins (+6 points). Light Chariots. Maryannu were the nobility of the Hurrian, Syrian or Phoenician subject kingdoms. Chariot Runners have Hand weapon, javelins and shield. Light Infantry. Chariot Runners. There may not be more units of chariot runners than there are of chariots. Cavalry Hand weapon and bow. Light Cavalry.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
            <infoLink id="80a1-00d8-e72e-922f" name="Hand Weapon" hidden="false" targetId="a423-b782-e1ce-43e2" type="profile"/>
          </infoLinks>
          <costs>
            <cost name="pts" typeId="points" value="76"/>
          </costs>
        </selectionEntry>
      </selectionEntries>
