              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hittite Chariot have Driver and one crewman armed with hand weapon, thrusting spear, javelins, light armour and shield. May add a second crewman to gain an extra attack, armed with javelins (+ 7 points). Light Chariots. Chariot Runners have Hand weapon, javelins and shield. Light Infantry. Chariot Runners. There may not be more units of chariot runners than there are of chariots. Cavalry Hand weapon and bow. Light Cavalry.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
