              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Guards have hand weapon, thrusting spear and shield. Guards may exchange thrusting spear and shield for 2 handed weapon (free). May have light armour (+2 points).</characteristic>
