              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Lukka (Sea People) Hand weapon, javelins and shield. Option: may have light armour (+2 points). Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Habiru have Hand weapon and javelins. Light Infantry. Warband (rule 2 does not apply) Syrians Hand weapon and javelins. may have bows (+2 points). Light Infantry. Skirmishers have Hand weapon and short bow or javelins. Option: May have buckler (free). Skirmishers. Slingers Hand weapon and sling. May have buckler (free). Skirmishers.</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
